#ASSERT (`May this marketing message be sent to me` WITH `the message reached me by` IS `a facsimile machine`, `the message is for direct marketing` IS TRUE, `I did not ask for the message` IS TRUE, `I am a natural person` IS TRUE, `I gave my consent beforehand` IS FALSE, `the sender got my details from me as its customer` IS FALSE, `I gave them when buying a product or service` IS FALSE, `I gave them lawfully under Directive 95/46/EC` IS FALSE, `the sender is the business I bought from` IS FALSE, `the message sells the sender's own products or services` IS FALSE, `the products or services are similar to what I bought` IS FALSE, `I was clearly and distinctly offered a way to object` IS FALSE, `the offer to object was free` IS FALSE, `the offer to object was easy` IS FALSE, `I was offered it when the details were collected` IS FALSE, `I refused at the start` IS FALSE, `I was offered it with every message` IS FALSE, `the sender's identity is disguised or concealed` IS FALSE, `the message breaks Article 6 of Directive 2000/31/EC` IS FALSE, `there is no valid address to ask them to stop` IS FALSE, `the message pushes me to a website that breaks that Article` IS FALSE, `national law has chosen` IS `national legislation has not been stated`, `I do not wish to receive these messages` IS FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE -- 286. Art 13(1) [individual seat]: extra: fax from a stranger, I never consented. Guide: "only"
